{"id":"ea2ed81f5a3df51c","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-reflection-companion.md","title":"Finite Reflection Companion","display":"df-reflection-companion — Finite Reflection Companion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-reflection-companion","aliases":["89-df-reflection-companion"],"display":"df-reflection-companion — Finite Reflection Companion","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","[[89-df-modal-sequent]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-reflection-companion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-reflection-companion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reflection-companion — Finite Reflection Companion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，选固定的可计算语法树编码，按码递增枚举有限集合\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0,\\ldots,C_{k-1}\">\\(C_0,\\ldots,C_{k-1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\\langle\\rangle=\\top\">\\(\\bigwedge\\langle\\rangle=\\top\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span> 和其他派生联结词先展开。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}companion}\\vdash\nA^{s}\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\bigwedge\\langle\\Box C_i\\to C_i\\mid i&lt;k\\rangle\\right)\\to A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}companion}\\vdash\nA^{s}\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\bigwedge\\langle\\Box C_i\\to C_i\\mid i&lt;k\\rangle\\right)\\to A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，印刷页 131–132；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n按原书加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的每个子公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的反射实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C\\to C\">\\(\\Box C\\to C\\)</span>，包括并未作为盒内容出现的子公式。顺序编码使这成为唯一语法输出；不同枚举得到命题等价的公式。对本语言的公式，子公式集非空，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>；空折叠的基准仍取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"C_0,\\ldots,C_{k-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge\\langle\\rangle=\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}companion}\\vdash\nA^{s}\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\bigwedge\\langle\\Box C_i\\to C_i\\mid i<k\\rangle\\right)\\to A.","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box C\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false}],"bytes":1265,"backlinks":[{"id":"9e926c452321080c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-reflection-companion]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]] → [[89-lem-solovay-limit-properties]] → [[89-lem-solovay-truth]] → [[89-lem-solovay-lem2]] → [[89-thm-solovay-theorem]] → [[89-df-reflection-companion]] → [[89-thm-gls-completeness]] → [[89-cor-gls-decidable]] → [[89-thm-uniform-solovay-realization]]"}],"outgoing":["71b4f56d6213ff7c","ca21b68a25f1afc2"]}